*
# Deny everything, then allow back. Which means this list is half of a pair: a
# file the Dockerfile COPYs is not in the build context unless it is also named
# here, and the failure is a build error rather than a missing file at runtime.
# tests/build.test.ts walks the server's imports and checks both halves agree.
!dist
!src/server.ts
!src/stats.ts
